{
  "lines": {
    "es": [
      {
        "id": "llegada",
        "text": "Vamos a empezar respirando. Pies en el suelo, manos sobre las piernas, hombros sueltos."
      },
      {
        "id": "instruccion",
        "text": "Si en algún punto notas una pequeña resistencia, detente ahí unos segundos. Ese es tu punto de apoyo. El cuerpo se reajusta solo."
      },
      {
        "id": "ojos",
        "text": "Cierra los ojos. Esta vez, sin mirar, sube el brazo muy despacio."
      },
      {
        "id": "cortas",
        "text": "Para. Y ahora vuelve, igual de lento."
      }
    ],
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "arrive",
        "text": "Let's begin by breathing. Feet on the floor, hands on your thighs, shoulders loose."
      },
      {
        "id": "instruction",
        "text": "If at some point you notice a slight resistance, stop there for a few seconds. That is your support point. The body readjusts on its own."
      },
      {
        "id": "eyes",
        "text": "Close your eyes. This time, without looking, raise your arm very slowly."
      },
      {
        "id": "short",
        "text": "Hold. And now come back, just as slowly."
      }
    ]
  },
